	(text_box "ESP32-S3-MINI-1x\n\n*In module variants that have embedded OSPI PSRAM, i.e., that embed ESP32-S3R8, pins IO35, IO36 and IO37 are connected to the OSPI PSRAM and are not available for other uses.\n\nNote:\nESP32-S3 har four strapping pins: IO0, IO3, IO45 and IO46.\n\nIO0, IO45 and IO46 are connected to the chip's internal weak pull-up/pull-down during the chip reset.\n\nIO3 is floating by default."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.92 139.7 0)
		(size 35.56 40.64)
